ign="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Apache II at admission</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">19 (6&#x02013;34)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">21 (6&#x02013;34)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">14.5 (10&#x02013;27)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.08</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Ventilation Cause(%)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.21</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>Acute respiratory failure</italic></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">69 (59.5)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">39 (54.2)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">30 (68.2)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>Decreased consciousness</italic></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">30 (25.9)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">19 (26.4)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">11 (25.0)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>Hemodynamic Instability</italic></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">13 (11.2)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10 (13.9)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">3 (6.8)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><italic>Others</italic></td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4 (3.4)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4 (5.5)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Days in protocol</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">8 (3&#x02013;26)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">7.5 (3&#x02013;26)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">8 (3&#x02013;8)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.97</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Extubated (%)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">70 (60.3)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">49 (68%)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">21 (47.7%)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.034</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Weaning failure (%)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">18 (25.7)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">14 (28.6)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4 (19)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.55</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Ramsay scale, mean</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5 (0.4&#x02013;6)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">4.8 (0.4&#x02013;6)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">5.5 (3.1&#x02013;6)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.028</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Mean capillary glucose</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">141 (99&#x02013;260)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">139 (99&#x02013;210)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">159 (99&#x02013;260)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.08</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">% days in PSV</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">40 (0&#x02013;100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">45.5 (0&#x02013;100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">27.5 (0&#x02013;100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.044</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">% days with sedation</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">90.2 (0&#x02013;100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">86 (0&#x02013;100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">100 (0&#x02013;100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.81</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">% days with NMB agents</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0 (0&#x02013;25)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0 (0&#x02013;25)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0 (0&#x02013;25)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.72</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">% days with steroids</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">83.3 (0&#x02013;100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">84.9 (0&#x02013;100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">80.9 (0&#x02013;100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.59</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">% days with SIRS</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">93.6 (14&#x02013;100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">100 (14&#x02013;100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">83.3 (14&#x02013;100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.27</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">% days of fasting</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">16.6 (0&#x02013;100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">14.6 (0&#x02013;100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">20 (0&#x02013;100)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.18</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn1-cln63_1p0033"><p>MIP = Maximal inspiratory pressure. MIP+ = group of patients with increased MIP during mechanical ventilation. MIP- = group of patients with decreased MIP during mechanical ventilation. Low MIP = values &#x0003c; 80 cm H<sub>2</sub>O for women and &#x0003c; 100 cm H<sub>2</sub>O for men. Weaning failure = reintubation in less than 48 hours. PSV = Pressure support ventilation. NMB agents = Neuromuscular blocking agents. SIRS = Systemic Inflammatory Response Syndrome. Values are expressed as median values with maximum and minimum values in parentheses.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="t2-cln63_1p0033" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Relationship between MIP trend and limb muscle strength.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">All Patients</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">MIP+</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">MIP-</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">p</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">N (%)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">69</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">48 (69.6)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">21 (30.4)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1"/></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">MRC score</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">46 (0&#x02013;60)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">45.5 (0&#x02013;60)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">48 (0&#x02013;60)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.72</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">% patients with ICU paresis</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">36 (52.2)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">26 (54.2)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">10 (47.6)</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.79</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn2-cln63_1p0033"><p>MIP = Maximal inspiratory pressure. MIP+ = group of patients with increased MIP during mechanical ventilation. MIP- = group of patients with decreased MIP during mechanical ventilation. MRC score = Medical Research Council score. ICU paresis = patients with an MRC score less than 48.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>